        <mxCell id="note_N1" value="Every use case of the Reader, the Writer, the&lt;br&gt;Magazine and the Administrator includes «Sign in».&lt;br&gt;The assistant needs the premium plan: «Consume the&lt;br&gt;AI allowance» has the condition [plan = premium].&lt;br&gt;The administrator role is granted in the database,&lt;br&gt;never through the interface." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=10;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;fontStyle=2;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="2801" width="340" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
